Z||000000||FIEROCIOUS||02-05-2000||01:05 AM||||I just installed Eibach's "Sport" springs and they do not sit in the spring perch when the car is jacked up (they move around!) Has anyone had this problem with the ST's?<BR>I called Chris the head tech at Eibach and he said this is normal. Has anyone had it pop out in driving conditions? ||||reg||1
